		"description": "<p><strong>Iron Rite — Chain.</strong> 1 Action, Reach: 6. Remove Soul Touched from the target: a Huge or smaller target is Restrained, 1 turn. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Using this Rite checks the target for your Soul Touched and removes it (the module warns but lets you proceed if the target isn’t marked).</em></p><p><em>[A] The chat card applies Restrained. [M] Only Huge or smaller targets; remove it after 1 turn. [M] You may make a melee weapon attack as part of the same Action (ignore Rushed Attack).</em></p>",
